    <description>Opportunities that had the DCAI SPR+ Deal $ KPI  during June 1st, June 8th, June 15th, June 22nd OR June 29th snapshots and no longer do
PLUS were created Jan 1 or later + not already approved, not lost nor cancelled nor exclude from KPI</description>
